>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md\">../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2SimpleFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6SimpleFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2SimpleFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6SimpleFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite.md\">58-df-finite.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\">\\(f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\\)</span>；函数图及定义域使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\in[\\mathbb R]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\;(f^{-1}[\\{r\\}]\\in\\mathcal A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\in[\\mathbb R]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\;(f^{-1}[\\{r\\}]\\in\\mathcal A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2SimpleFunction}_S(f,X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2SimpleFunction}_S(f,X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6SimpleFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6SimpleFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5SimpleFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A simple function has finite range and measurable fibers.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md","status":"resolved","id":"109d01fe15884218","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-measurable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)$ and $\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]], [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","sta